date-released: "2026-08-05"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Ahmad-Mahmoudi-coder/Process-Heat-RDM"
type: software
abstract: >-
  Authoritative proof-of-concept for Decision-Centred Modelling (DCM),
  demonstrating a site-to-region industrial process-heat decision
  (electric-boiler vs biomass-boiler pathways) at Fonterra Edendale,
  Southland, New Zealand, evaluated across 100 paired futures under deep
  uncertainty. Numerical results are illustrative of the method under
  declared low-to-medium-maturity scope conditions and are not calibrated
  operational guidance.
